            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1187-f3" n="3" xml:id="d1187-f3-content">
                <p>Livingston Satterthwaite.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1187-f4" n="4" xml:id="d1187-f4-content">
                <p>Of the Provisional International Civil Aviation Organization.</p>
            </note>
